result
.ez/*
# except a dependency marked `vendor = true` in ez.toml: ez adds, drops and
# rewrites a `!.ez/lib/<hash>` line for each, and these two rules are what let
# that line work. Nothing is vendored today; a clone fills .ez/lib with
# `sh bootstrap.sh`, `ez fetch`, or nix.
!.ez/lib
.ez/lib/*
bin/ez.bin
.claude/
